comment.narrative:
•Four (4) investigations conducted including two on SGBV and two on insecurity and inter-ethnic conflict in Elgeyo Marakwet and Marsabit respectively;
•Three (3) follow-up investigations conducted in Naivasha and Nairobi;
•Recommendations on appropriate resolution mechanisms of the investigated complaints made.

•265 complaints were processed across the KNCHR regions;
•188 of those complaints were by male complainants while 63 were by females and 6 related to intersex person;
•Twenty-one complaints (8%) of the total complaints received were by or relating to rights of PWDs;
•Three (3) Strategic partners engagement forums held with partners in Wajir, Kilifi and Isiolo;
•One (1) Joint public complaints handling initiatives was held in Kaloleni GK Prison
•156 complaints received and processed towards resolution.
•One (1) debriefing session for HQ staff was held at the Nairobi National Park.
